{
  "title": "ISic000425. Funerary inscription for L. Caiat[---] Argy[---]",
  "body": "<div id=\"editions\"><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2026-09-16, magazzino B, Museo arch. reg. P.Orsi, Siracusa</div><div id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"la\">  <div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  <a id=\"al1-interpretive\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Lucius · Caiat\n                    Argy\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Lucius\">L(ucius)</span> · <span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caiat\"><span data-text=\"Caiat\">Caiat</span></span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] <br id=\"al2-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Argy\"><span data-text=\"Argy\">Argy</span></span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span>  <br id=\"al3-interpretive\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>vixit · anṇ[os <span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>] </span></div>  <p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div><div class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag; edition source: autopsy Prag 2026-09-16, magazzino B, Museo arch. reg. P.Orsi, Siracusa</div><div id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"la\"><div class=\"textpart\" lang=\"la\"><span class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\"><a id=\"al1-diplomatic\"><!--0--></a><span class=\"linenumber\">1</span><span data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Lucius · Caiat\n                    Argy\"><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Lucius\">L</span>·<span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Caiat\"><span data-text=\"Caiat\">CAIAT</span></span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]<br id=\"al2-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">2</span><span data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Argy\"><span data-text=\"Argy\">ARGY</span></span>[<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span><br id=\"al3-diplomatic\"><span class=\"linenumber\">3</span>VIXIT·AN.[..<span dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---</span>]</span></div><p class=\"miniapp\"></p></div></div>  <div id=\"facsimile-images\"><h2>Facsimile Images</h2><a href=\"ISic000425_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2026-09-16\" src=\"ISic000425_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000425.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2026-09-16\" src=\"ISic000425-thumb.jpg\"></a><a href=\"ISic000425_rear_tiled.tif\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2026-09-16\" src=\"ISic000425_rear_tiled-thumb.tif\"></a><a href=\"ISic000425_rear.jpg\"><img title=\"I.Sicily with the permission of the Assessorato Regionale dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana - Dipartimento dei Beni Culturali e dell’Identità Siciliana; photo J. Prag 2026-09-16\" src=\"ISic000425_rear-thumb.jpg\"></a></div>  <div id=\"apparatus\"><h4>Apparatus criticus</h4><ul><li><span><span>Text from autopsy</span></span></li></ul></div>  <div id=\"translation\"><h2>English translation</h2><p class=\"translation-author\"><a href=\"http://orcid.org/0000-0003-3819-8537\">Jonathan Prag</a></p>  <p>Lucius Caiat[---] Argy[---] lived [--] years.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"commentary\"><h2>commentary</h2>  <p>The nomen could be Caiatius or Caiatinus (from Latium). The nomen is most likely Argyrus (or a variant thereof), although Argynnus is also attested. It seems likely not much is actually lost, with the nomen centred and 'annos' abbreviated and the age following.</p>  </div>  <div id=\"bibliography\"><h2>bibliography</h2>  <ul><li></li><li> Mommsen 1883 <a href=\"http://arachne.uni-koeln.de/item/buchseite/650768\" target=\"_blank\">7145</a>  <a href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000589</a></li></ul>  <ul><li></li></ul>  </div>  <div id=\"handnote\"><p>Large, reasonably wide module, v-cut letters, very regular, with simple and consistent standard serifs; tear-drop shaped interpuncts. The letters bear paint, brown/red in colour, unclear if original or modern.</p> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    </div><div id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence.  </div>",
